        "cooked": "<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-85\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-85\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"938C83\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-85\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Editor's Note #85</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Good morning, everyone! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:53:03 A long Editor's Note! What is happening?! And it's not just because of the frankly-not-good-radio unboxing at the end of the recording! But first, the upcoming schedule:   Tuesday, December 3rd:...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Upcoming Schedule</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday, December 3rd: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#302</span> - Writers’ Room: Setback vs The Adhesivist</li>\n<li>Tuesday, December 10th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#303</span> - Writers’ Room: Akash’Thriya vs Necrosis</li>\n<li>Tuesday, December 17th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#86</span></li>\n<li>Tuesday, December 24th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#304</span> - Writers’ Room: Santa Scholar</li>\n<li>Tuesday, December 31st: No Episode! End of year break!</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Expected Recording Schedule</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Wednesday, November 27th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#302</span> - Writers’ Room: Setback vs The Adhesivist</li>\n<li>Wednesday, December 27th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#303</span> - Writers’ Room: Akash’Thriya vs Necrosis</li>\n<li>Friday, December 13th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#86</span></li>\n<li>Friday, December 20th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#304</span> - Writers’ Room: Santa Scholar</li>\n<li>Friday, December 27th: No Episode! End of year break!</li>\n</ul>",
