        "raw": "https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-85\n \nUpcoming Schedule\n* Tuesday, December 3rd: Episode #302 - Writers’ Room: Setback vs The Adhesivist\n* Tuesday, December 10th: Episode #303 - Writers’ Room: Akash’Thriya vs Necrosis\n* Tuesday, December 17th: Editor’s Note #86\n* Tuesday, December 24th: Episode #304 - Writers’ Room: Santa Scholar\n* Tuesday, December 31st: No Episode! End of year break!\n\n\nExpected Recording Schedule\n* Wednesday, November 27th: Episode #302 - Writers’ Room: Setback vs The Adhesivist\n* Wednesday, December 27th: Episode #303 - Writers’ Room: Akash’Thriya vs Necrosis\n* Friday, December 13th: Editor’s Note #86\n* Friday, December 20th: Episode #304 - Writers’ Room: Santa Scholar\n* Friday, December 27th: No Episode! End of year break!",
