        "read": false,
        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I wonder if the sound-making is an intrinsic part of heavy-thing-lifting. :thinking:\n\nI'm starting to think they don't in fact perform the outro song live every episode...\n\nCan't wait for Dragon Farm Simulator from Greater Than Games. :D\n\nIgnore, Submit, Attack, the new FMK.\n\nFirst there's a bear with him, now it's three ankylosaurs?\n\nI do love this mind palace burn-in for the post-its room. :D\n\nWhat good are the conversations if we don't hear them though?\n\nTrust me when I say, the unboxing was pretty cool live. :)",
