        "id": 261549,
        "name": "Casey",
        "username": "TheRealPeacockTalk",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/dec6dc/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2024-11-20T00:00:53.156Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Adam and Christopher saying that Freedom Five is canonical to Universe 1, it’s just a retelling of events, doesn’t make a ton of sense to me. How can both be true?</p>\n<p>Like, Freedom Five says that the Blade Battalion are the disorganized crime forces of Megalopolis now unified. And while that could have been a story, that’s certainly not what the Blade Battalion forces are in summary.</p>",
