        "cooked": "<p>Relistening to this, and the time travel discussion reminded me that I think that <em>Day of the Tentacle</em> is still the best oldie but goodie for “time manipulation” video game stories.</p>\n<p>(Though I think <em>I Was a Teenage Exocolonist</em> is a notable one where playing with foreknowledge is concerned if not strictly actual time travel.)</p>",
